OL,3,GNEWSASafety warning as lifeguards to
OL,4,Apause for winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RNLI has reiterated water safety
OL,7,Fadvice as it brings its summer
OL,8,Flifeguard provision to an end at
OL,9,Fbeaches in Kent and Sussex.
OL,11,FThe charity's lifeguards in the region
OL,12,Fwill begin their pauses over winter
OL,13,Fstarting from Sunday.
OL,15,FIn total, the organisation patrols 239
OL,16,Fbeaches in the UK and the Channel
OL,17,FIslands on both a voluntary and local
OL,18,Fauthority-funded basis.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
