OL,3,GNEWSASafety warning as lifeguards to
OL,4,Apause for winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Stevens, South East lifeguard lead,
OL,7,Fsaid the 2026 summer had been "one of
OL,8,Fthe busiest and most demanding seasons"
OL,9,Fin the service's history due to
OL,10,Funprecedented hot and dry weather.
